        b. 1.8V native NMOS model

         .lib TT_NA : Typical 1.8V native NMOS model
              SS_NA : Slow 1.8V native NMOS model
              FF_NA : Fast 1.8V native NMOS model
              SF_NA : Slow 1.8V native NMOS model
              FS_NA : Fast 1.8V native NMOS model

           Model name    length range         width range     unit
                         low     high         low    high    
          ----------------------------------------------------------
            nanch        0.5     10.0         0.22   100.      um
          ----------------------------------------------------------

         The parameter HDIF listed in model card is TSMC minimum-rule value,
         users must change this value according to their layout.
   
         (ps: for more information about ACM = 12, please refer to the HSPICE
              release note. User must specify AS/AD and PS/PD in the netlist
              to avoid zero junction capacitance and to obtain correct
              junction leakage current.)


